  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" /></a></p><h2><p data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"70\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🎈&nbsp;<span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\">שיחה בציורים – פנחס, המגפה וברית השלום</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">👫 </span>בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (נוֹפְלִים)<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">הֵיי, רָאִיתָ אֶת בְּנוֹת מוֹאָב?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">הֵן מַזְמִינוֹת אוֹתָנוּ לַמְּסִבּוֹת שֶׁלָּהֶן…</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">🏕️ </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַחֲנֶה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (נֶחְלָשׁ)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מַתְחִילִים לִמְעוֹד, לְהִיכָּנֵס לַעֲבוֹדָה זָרָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מַתְחִילָה מַגֵּפָה, אֲנָשִׁים מֵתִים…</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">📖 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מֹשֶׁה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מִתְפַּלֵּל)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֵיךְ הִגַּעְנוּ לְמַצָּב הַזֶּה?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מָה עוֹד אֶפְשָׁר לַעֲשׂוֹת כְּדֵי לַעֲצוֹר אֶת זֶה?</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">👨‍🦰 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זִמְרִי</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מִתְגָּרֶה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מַה הַבְּעָיָה?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי מֵבִיא אִתִּי נְסִיכָה מִדְיָנִית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">כּוּלָם רוֹאִים, וְאַף אֶחָד לֹא אוֹמֵר כְּלוּם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">🔥 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פִּנְחָס</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (בּוֹעֵר מִבִּפְנִים)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי לֹא יָכוֹל לִשְׁתּוֹק עוֹד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">הָעָם מִתְפּוֹרֵר, וְכּוּלָם שׁוֹתְקִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מִישֶׁהוּ צָרִיךְ לְקַנֵּא לִכְבוֹד ה'.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">⚔️ </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רֹמַח</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (דָּרוּךְ)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי מוּכָן, פִּנְחָס.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">בּוֹא נֵלֵךְ לַעֲשׂוֹת אֶת מַה שֶּׁצָּרִיךְ.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">💔 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַגֵּפָה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (עוֹצֶרֶת)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">רֶגַע… מַה קוֹרֶה כָּאן?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">פִּנְחָס קָם? עָשָׂה מַעֲשֶׂה?<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">טוֹב, אֲנִי מַפְסִיקָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">✋ </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ה'</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מְרוּצֶה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">פִּנְחָס קִנֵּא אֶת קִנְאָתִי וְהֵשִׁיב אֶת חֲרוֹן אַפִּי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲנִי נוֹתֵן לוֹ בְּרִית שָׁלוֹם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"110\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">❤️ </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֵב</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\"> (מְהַרְהֵר)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">לְפָעָמִים קִנְאָה נִרְאֵית מַפְחִידָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">אֲבָל כְּשֶׁעוֹשִׂים אוֹתָהּ לְשֵׁם שָׁמַיִם,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">הִיא מַצִּילָה אֶת כּוּלָם.</span></span></p></h2><div><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת</span></h2></div><!--זהו החלק השני של הקוד--><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;פנחס, שלום, ישראל, צֹרְרִים, ירדן, יְרֵחוֹ.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span>⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/b1718b4f6fcb9d76eb.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"455\" data-original-width=\"463\" height=\"314\" src=\"/assets/images/content/b1718b4f6fcb9d76eb.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא?</span></h2></span></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><p></p><ol><li>כָּזְבִּי הָיְתָה בִּתּוֹ שֶׁל צוּר?</li><li>שֶׂרַח הָיְתָה הַבַּת שֶׁל אָשֵׁר?</li><li>לַמִּלְחָמָה בְּמִדְיָן, הִתְגַּיְּסוּ מִגִּיל 25 וָמַעְלָה?</li><li>מִשְׁפַּחַת הַזַּרְחִי יָצְאָה מִזֶּרַח?</li><li>חַג הַסֻּכּוֹת חָל בַּעֲשָׂרָה בְּתִשְׁרֵי?</li><li>הַחֹדֶשׁ הָרִאשׁוֹן הוּא חֹדֶשׁ נִיסָן?</li><li>לִצְלָפְחָד בֶּן חֵפֶר הָיוּ 5 בָּנִים?</li><li>לְאַבָּא שֶׁל קְהָת קָרְאוּ עַמְרָם?</li><li>נְמוּאֵל הָיָה אָח שֶׁל דָּתָן וַאֲבִירָם</li><li>מִשְּׁפוּפָם יָצְאָה מִשְׁפַּחַת הַשְּׁפוּפׇּמִי</li></ol></span></div></div>"
}
